<title>MALAYSIA: Pernas International six-mth net down.</title>
<headline>Pernas International six-mth net down.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		20.87	vs	21.85</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	5.6	 vs	 5.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		107.58	vs     101.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 34.67	vs	32.68</p>
<p>    Minorities   less     4.19	vs less  4.22</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)    4.0	 vs	 4.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Pernas International Holdings Bhd. It is a property, plantations, construction and hotel concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201-4813)</p>
</text>
